%N A126400 Number of base 13 n-digit numbers with adjacent digits differing by two or less.
%C A126400 [Empirical] a(base,n)=a(base-1,n)+5^(n-1) for base>=2n-1; a(base,n)=a(base-1,n)+5^(n-1)-2 when base=2n-2.
%H A126400 Rafał Wiktorowicz, <a href="/A126371/a126371_1.pdf">Proofs of the conjectured recurrences and generating functions for the adjacent-digits family</a>, 2026.
%H A126400 <a href="/index/Rec#order_06">Index entries for linear recurrences with constant coefficients</a>, signature (8,-14,-12,25,3,-9).
%F A126400 G.f.: (1+5*x-31*x^2-3*x^3+50*x^4-3*x^5-18*x^6) / ((1-x)*(1-7*x+7*x^2+19*x^3-6*x^4-9*x^5)). - _Colin Barker_, Jul 18 2017
%o A126400 (S/R) stvar $[N]:(0..M-1) init $[]:=0 asgn $[]->{*} kill +[i in 0..N-2](($[i]`-$[i+1]`>2)+($[i+1]`-$[i]`>2))
%Y A126400 Cf. Base 13 differing by one or less A126367.
